**Tip:**

Notice the auto-generated server with a `url` value of `/api/v1`, taken from the `root_path`.

In the docs UI at [http://127.0.0.1:9999/api/v1/docs](http://127.0.0.1:9999/api/v1/docs) it would look like:

**Tip:**

